---
import StaticPageLayout from "../layouts/StaticPageLayout.astro";
---

<StaticPageLayout
  title="Contact"
  eyebrow="GET IN TOUCH"
  description="Information about contacting LUDIVON for editorial, correction, privacy and business enquiries."
>
  <h2>Contact LUDIVON</h2>

  <p>
    We intend to provide a clear contact route for readers,
    contributors and organisations with relevant enquiries.
  </p>

  <h2>Enquiries we intend to support</h2>

  <ul class="policy-list">
    <li>Corrections and factual accuracy reports.</li>
    <li>Questions about published guides.</li>
    <li>Editorial and contribution enquiries.</li>
    <li>Privacy-related requests.</li>
    <li>Relevant business and publication enquiries.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="prelaunch-note">
    <p>
      <strong>Contact details are not yet published.</strong>
    </p>

    <p>
      A verified public contact address and the appropriate
      enquiry instructions will be added before LUDIVON's
      public launch.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Please do not send confidential or sensitive information
    through unofficial channels.
  </p>
</StaticPageLayout>